<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>ru</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Yoru</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleLocalizations</key>
	<array>
		<string>ru</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>Yoru</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>2.3.4.2</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>37</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoadsForMedia</key>
		<true/>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<key>NSBonjourServices</key>
	<array>
		<string>_nightanime._tcp</string>
		<string>_yoru-sync._tcp</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Камера нужна, чтобы отсканировать QR-код входа в аккаунт Yoru на другом устройстве.</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Yoru находит приставку Yoru TV и домашний сервер Yoru, чтобы синхронизировать историю просмотра.</string>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
	<key>ShikimoriClientId</key>
	<string>$(SHIKI_CLIENT_ID)</string>
	<key>ShikimoriClientSecret</key>
	<string>$(SHIKI_CLIENT_SECRET)</string>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>audio</string>
	</array>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UIRequiresFullScreen</key>
	<false/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
